@startuml SD-01 Login
title SD-01 Login

actor User
participant "Frontend App" as App
participant "Auth API" as Auth
database "Database" as DB

User -> App: Enter email and password
App -> Auth: POST /auth/login
Auth -> DB: Find user by email
DB --> Auth: User record
Auth -> Auth: Verify password and active status

alt Login valid
    Auth --> App: JWT token + user role
    App -> App: Store token and user
    App -> User: Redirect to allowed page
else Login invalid
    Auth --> App: Error
    App -> User: Show login error
end

@enduml